{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2023-01-31 17:51:00', 'title': 'AM BEST COMMENTS ON CREDIT RATINGS OF AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES FOLLOWING CHANGE IN LEADERSHIP', 'text': 'OLDWICK, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AM BEST HAS COMMENTED THAT THE CREDIT RATINGS (RATINGS) OF AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (AIG) (HEADQUARTERED IN NEW YORK, NY) [NYSE: AIG], ITS PROPERTY/CASUALTY SUBSIDIARIES, AND THE MEMBERS OF AIG LIFE & RETIREMENT GROUP, ALL REMAIN UNCHANGED FOLLOWING THE JAN. 30, 2023, ANNOUNCEMENT THAT MARK LYONS, INTERIM CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL CHIEF ACTUARY AND HEAD OF PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT, WAS TERMINATED AND HAS LEFT THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY.'}